                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Basi sasa, nakusihi, bwana wangu, mfalme, na asikie maneno ya mtumishi wake. Ikiwa ni BWANA aliyekuchochea juu yangu, na akubali sadaka; bali ikiwa ni wanadamu, na walaaniwe mbele za BWANA; kwa sababu wamenifukuza leo, nisishikamane na urithi wa BWANA, wakisema, Nenda, ukatumikie miungu mingine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
