                  "text": "Isa 54:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ndipo Sauli akamwambia Daudi, Ubarikiwe, Daudi, mwanangu; utatenda mambo makuu, tena hakika yako utashinda. Basi, Daudi akaenda zake; Sauli naye akarudi kwao.",
          "type": "text",
